*
!pyproject.toml
!src
!src/**
# The map's own data. Without these the image builds, the server starts, /map/data
# answers 200 -- and returns zero pins, because the dataset it names is not in the
# image. That is what shipped until TICK-337.
!data/precatalogue.json
!data/external
!data/external/**
# The curated on-site publication (TICK-333). Same failure mode as the dataset
# above: without it the map builds, serves 200, and is missing the 46 on-site
# scans with nothing anywhere saying so.
!data/published_scans.jsonl
